# Catalog migrations

Follow the project skill `.cursor/skills/add-catalog-migration/SKILL.md`.

- Next step = next six-digit file under `core/database/migrations/`. No CLI; `Open`/`Create` apply it.
- Do not edit shipped `NNNNNN.sql`. Do not use timestamps. `user_version` is not product `VERSION`.
- `go test ./core/database/` is the lint (names, gaps, empty SQL, embed matches init).
